SUMMARY:Demuth on King Guided Tours
DESCRIPTION:Visit the Demuth Museum of Art on King second and fourth Saturdays at 1 pm for a guided tour! Our Demuth docents will guide you through the home and studio of Charles Demuth and talk about his life and work as they relate to each room of the house. Tours are by donation – recommended donation is $10.
