SUMMARY:2828 - Festive Brunch
DESCRIPTION:Join our Instructor Cat Alwine for a festive Holiday Brunch Cooking Class! Learn to prepare a delightful spread featuring seasonal favorites. Chef Cat will guide you through creating a memorable brunch that’s perfect for celebrating the season. Discover new recipes and techniques! \nHands on. Ages 21 and up.  \n\nEggnog Monkey bread\nHomemade Chicken Apple Sausage\nSpinach\, Feta and Cherry Tomato Frittata\nSpiced Cranberry Spritzer 
