DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\n\nMeet Author Greg P
 izzoli!Join us at the library for a special visit with award-winning autho
 r and illustrator Greg Pizzoli! He is the creator of many beloved children
 ’s books\, including The Watermelon Seed\, Good Night Owl\, The Book Hog
 \, Number One Sam\, and the hilarious Baloney and Friends graphic novel se
 ries. Children will have the opportunity to meet Greg\, learn about his wo
 rk as an author and illustrator\, and discover the creativity behind bring
 ing stories to life.Don’t miss this exciting opportunity to meet a favor
