SUMMARY:Holiday Tree Lighting & Santa's Arrival at Tanger
DESCRIPTION:Kick off the holiday season with us at Tanger Outlets Lancaster for a magical\, vintage-inspired Holiday Celebration!\n\nJoin us for an evening filled with nostalgic holiday charm as we welcome Santa for his grand arrival and light up the season together. Bring the whole family and enjoy festive entertainment and activities\, including:\n Santa’s Grand Arrival Holiday Carolers Toy Soldiers & The Nutcracker Hot Cocoa Station Ornament Decorating Letters to Santa Holiday Tree Lighting\n\nCome make merry memories with us and experience the magic of the holiday season at Tanger Outlets Lancaster!
