X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Mickeysblackbox": "https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/tune-up-radio-all-the-way-up/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:mickeysblackbox
X-SOURCE:Mickey's Black Box
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T230000
DTSTAMP:20261114T011423
CREATED:20260928T141934Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261112T181339Z
UID:10000833-1794681000-1794697200@mickeysblackbox.com
SUMMARY:Tune Up Radio: All the Way Up
DESCRIPTION:Saturday November 14th\, 2026\nShow | 6:30 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $18.80 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nPlease note this event is 21+ – Valid ID Required to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Tune Up Radio\n————————————————— \nJoin Lancaster’s dance music DJ collective as they take over the venue for their second annual “ALL THE WAY UP” party featuring resident DJs Major Vibes\, DJ Darling\, Blush & Mannie Freeze all blending house\, club\, disco\, techno\, club and dance music that you won’t hear at your standard weekend nights out in the area!\n\nThe team is presenting a “party in the round” setup for this event for the first time\, constructing a small DJ booth stage in the center of the venue. The crowd will fill in around the stage for an immersive dance party experience à la Boiler Room.\n\nIn addition\, this will be a “no phones on the dance floor” event.. low tack stickers will be distributed at the door to be placed over your phone cameras so everyone can be present and enjoy the party without distraction!\n\nIf you’re a fan of the type of electronic dance music you only hear in big city clubs\, this party is for you!\n\nCheck out Tune Up Radio’s YouTube channel to get an idea of what to expect.. this time in a much larger space with the same intimate energy!\n\nGrab your tickets today and we will see you there 🪩 !!\nJoin us for a very exciting installment of Tune Up Radio for a “party in the round” featuring Major Vibes\, DJ Darling\, Blush\, + Mannie Freeze.\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert* \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers. Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets. Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/tune-up-radio-all-the-way-up/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/09/tuneupbanner-rev.png
END:VEVENT
