SUMMARY:Beginner Kinusaiga Workshop: Christmas Tree
DESCRIPTION:Learn a super fun new hobby while creating a festive Christmas decoration! In this beginner-friendly kinusaiga workshop\, you’ll learn how to carve your choice of design\, and tuck and layer fabrics into a foam design to create a festive “no-sew quilt block”.\n\nThis will be an adults-only workshop due to the use of pen knives to carve your design into a foam block. You are welcome to bring your own food and drink to enjoy during the workshop.\n\nMinimum of 3 people required for workshop to run. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
