SUMMARY:Mahjong 101
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261116T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261116T194500
UID:41d45152cc70bc9ecd7162ba914186a5@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Gaming\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nGo from "What's a Bam
 ?" to "Mahjong!" in this five-week intensive designed for true beginners. 
 We’ll dive into the tiles\, the National Mah Jongg League card\, and the
  fast-paced strategy that makes the game a total blast. By the final week\
 , you’ll be playing with confidence and style!The Full-Table Commitment:
  Because each lesson builds directly on the last\, signing up for the firs
 t session means you are committed to the full journey. Please ensure you c
 an attend every class before registering!Schedule: Mondays & Tuesdays\, 6-
 8pmMonday\, November 2Tuesday\, November 3Monday\, November 9Tuesday\, Nov
 ember 10Monday\, November 16Tuesday\, November 17New Players Only\, Please
 !: To keep things fair and give everyone a shot at the tiles\, this course
  is strictly for true beginners. If you've already taken a Mahjong class a
 t any library branch in the county\, we ask that you leave this spot open 
 for someone who hasn't had the chance to learn yet. We love your enthusias
 m\, but this specific table is reserved for those who are brand new to the
  game!
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/mahjong-101-208286
