UID:80f0f509c06bbb7989065612fb1a4712@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Health & Wellness\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nMini Chef Mornings 
 with GIANT\, a fun and interactive nutrition program for children 3 to 6 y
 ears old! This engaging program will introduce young learners to the impor
 tance of healthy eating through hands-on activities and simple\, nutritiou
 s recipes.Guided by GIANT’s registered dietitian\, Miss Charlotte\, chil
 dren will explore fresh ingredients\, learn how to make balanced food choi
 ces\, and create delicious\, easy-to-make snacks.  Program Highlights:✅ 
 Hands-on recipe demonstrations with kid-friendly ingredients✅ Nutrition 
 lessons tailored for young learners✅ Take-home educational materials for
  families to learn togetherJoin us for this exciting opportunity to empowe
 r young minds with the knowledge and skills to make healthy choices—one 
 tasty bite at a time! Let’s get cooking and learning together! 🥕🍎
 🥦
LOCATION:Eastern Lancaster County\, NHD Activity Room
