BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/tabletop-rpgs-adults-165131"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Tabletop RPGs for Adults
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261118T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261118T200000
UID:556453d7e51135ccef5e9a2a28694263@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Adults\n\nJoin local GM Matt as he runs a variety of 
 Tabletop Role Playing Games that rotate each month. No experience in any s
 ystem is required and anyone interested in dipping their toes into the TTR
 PG world are welcomed and encouraged to join in on the fun! This month's g
 ame is Mothership!An Anti-Corporate Suicide RunThe stars were a dream for 
 us all - unlimited freedom in every direction imaginable. What we got inst
 ead was a corporate hellscape expanding exponentially\, forever.Now it com
 es for the Dream. Prospero’s Dream is a space station of enormous scale.
  Once owned by corporate interests and now ferociously independent\, it is
  not a nice place to live\, but those that live there are free from the co
 rporate yoke. At least they were.First welcomed as a partner in stability 
 and profit within Prospero’s Dream\, METAStatic\, Inc. has spread and fe
 stered\, bloating within every crack it can find in the station. They prom
 ised to stabilize the station’s O2 shortage. Instead\, they found an unl
 imited labor source in The Choke\, taking debtors on their last legs and t
 urning them into debt slaves. The station is being flooded with pro-corpor
 ate propaganda and the presence of MSI’s private military force\, the Pe
 acemakers\, is an ever more common sight. Execs walk around in premium sle
 eves while people beg for a handful of credits to fill their O2 credsticks
 .All that power\, all that entitlement\, all focused in a single corporate
  megabuilding at the heart of the dream. You are the lit match and this to
 wer is the tinder. Burn it all down. Give the Dream a fresh start.Even if 
 you're not there to see it. Registration is required. This group is for ad
 ults only.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Study Room #119
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/tabletop-rpgs-adults-165
 131
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
