CREATED:20251112T162620Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260825T171439Z
UID:10001457-1795023000-1795024800@www.saintjameslancaster.org
SUMMARY:Evening Prayer Via Zoom
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday Evening Prayer\nWednesdays with the Saints via Zoom Only\nClick here  to join Wednesday Evening Prayer. (This link can be used for every Wednesday Evening Prayer on Zoom. Passcode=WedEP) \n\nYours is the day\, O God\, yours also the night; you established the moon and the sun. You fixed all the boundaries of the earth; you made both summer and winter. Psalm 74:15\,16 \n\nI will bless the Lord who gives me counsel; my heart teaches me\, night after night. I have set the Lord always before me; because he is at my right hand\, I shall not fall. Psalm 16:7\,8 \n\nDaily prayers are said on a regular schedule at Saint James. On Wednesday evenings\, we invite you to explore and celebrate the inspiring lives of the saints at our Evening Prayer service. Join us each week as we remember some of the people who shaped the Church through the centuries using readings\, scripture\, prayers and music! We use liturgy from Common Worship: Daily Prayer and the commemorations are from Lesser Feasts and Fasts\, 2018. Invite a friend!
URL:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/event/evening-prayer-2023-07-05-2-2-3/2026-11-18/
LOCATION:Zoom Video Conferencing\, PA\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Saintjames-Thmb.jpg
GEO:41.2033216;-77.1945247
END:VEVENT
