SUMMARY:Impromptu Lunch Ride New Leola Test Route To Lititz and Back (31R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader CP Weaver**
 \n**Pace between 14-16 mph**\n**All are welcome to drive down to**\n**Func
 ks in Leola for lunch after the ride.**\n[https://www.funcks.com/](https:/
 /www.funcks.com/)\n\n**This ride is a social ride\, but cyclists are not e
 xpected to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable 
 paces. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking a
 lone or being dropped off the back of the last group. We will stop to regr
 oup as needed.**\n\n**Ride with GPS links:**\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/rout
 es/57633203\n\n**Helmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 wat
 er bottles\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 i
 nflator).**\n**Being a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. 
 Use this link to join the club.**\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/cont
 ent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/cont
 ent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n**Your RSVP is your agreement to abid
 e by the club's Code of Conduct** [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/co
 ntent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclu
 b.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)
 \n**and Rules of the Road**\n[https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content
 .aspx?](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_
 id=257148&module_id=325159)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3174094
 80/
