DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Babies\n\nBook Babies is a special time for babies
  to share stories\, songs\, rhymes and games with their grown-ups. Come pl
 ay with us in the Children’s Library! (Newborn to 17 months\, with adult
 ) Please add any additional registrants to your registration if more than 
 one child that will be participating in the program.Registration for Book 
 Babies will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, November 4th for Manheim Townshi
 p and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, November 6th for residents o
 f other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesProgram Limits - Patrons are limi
 ted to one session of multiple session programs per week.Cancellations- Pl
 ease check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has no
 t been cancelled.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration 
 for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from regist
 ering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cance
 l your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to
  allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in reg
 istration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the s
 tart of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The prog
 ram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot w
 ill be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If s
 pots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, regis
 trants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start
  time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
