DESCRIPTION:Community\, Music\, Storytime\, Babies\n\nCome wiggle\, giggle
 \, and grow with Miss Esther! Join us for 30 minutes of musical magic and 
 sweet stories designed especially for your littlest sprouts. We’ll be ga
 thered in the meeting room—just a hop\, skip\, and a jump across from th
 e circulation desk.This cozy circle is tailor-made for tiny explorers ages
  6 to 24 months. Because we want to keep things comfy for everyone\, pleas
 e only register your little ones in this age range. This is a special bond
 ing time for you and your baby\, so grown-ups must stay for all the fun—
 no drop-offs\, please!Is your little one blooming into a big kid? Once the
 y hit their 2nd birthday (past 24 months)\, they’re ready to join the ad
 venture at Family Story Time! Join us there every Tuesday at 9:30 or 10:30
  for even more library fun.A quick favor: If your plans change and you can
 't make it\, please let us know so another little friend can join the circ
 le as this class is usually booked up fast!
