 happy to host this celebration to provide opportunities for donation and b
 etter connect you with the non-profits located in\, or serving\, Greenfiel
 d.Greenfield GivesNov 20 | 3 - 7 PMS. Dale High Leadership Center  All are
  welcome as we celebrate with live music\, complimentary apps and beverage
 s\, donation stations\, and more! This event is open to all. You do not ne
 ed to be associated with Greenfield to attend.New This Year:Community Quil
 t Project - Help us create a collective work of art celebrating what commu
 nity means to you. Children and families will be invited to design quilt s
 quares inspired by kindness\, belonging\, friendship\, and giving back. To
 gether\, we'll create a visual reminder of the power of community.100 Acts
  of Generosity - Take the spirit of ExtraGive beyond the event. Choose an 
 envelope containing a simple act of kindness and commit to completing it. 
