 ening of games\, snacks\, photo opportunities\, giveaways\, and raffle bas
 kets as we celebrate ExtraGive. ExtraGive is a 24-hour community-wide fund
 raising campaign that brings together hundreds of nonprofits across Lancas
 ter County\, giving our community a chance to come together and support th
 e organizations that make a difference locally! Stop by the library\, have
