UID:10000794-1795201200-1795212000@mickeysblackbox.com
SUMMARY:Lil Mo Mozzarella
DESCRIPTION:Friday November 20th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nReserved Balcony\, Mezzanine\, & Riser Seating | $27.50 + Fees\nReserved Orchestra Seating | $38.80 + Fees\nVIP Orchestra Seat + Meet & Greet with Lil Mo Mozzarella | $60.10 + Fees\n(This ticket includes a reserved seat and Meet & Greet) \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Big Fan Presents\n—————————————————\nLil Mo is a nationally touring stand-up comedian with a blue-collar edge\, an unmistakable New York voice\, and a style that is about as New York as they come. \nBorn in Brooklyn and raised in Queens\, he turns real life into big laughs\, from jobsite chaos and family stories to marriage\, fatherhood\, and the neighborhood characters everyone recognizes. Fast\, honest\, and unfiltered\, a Lil Mo show feels like hanging with the funniest guy on the block.  \nLeave ya feelings at home\, but make sure ya bring ya wallet! \nCheck out Lil Mo Mozzarella here!\nWebsite | Instagram | Facebook\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/lil-mo-mozzarella/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/04/Approved-photo-scaled-e1785690015429.jpg
END:VEVENT
