X-SOURCE:Mickey's Black Box
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T213000
DTSTAMP:20261114T011423
CREATED:20260811T151450Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811T151604Z
UID:10000822-1795284000-1795296600@mickeysblackbox.com
SUMMARY:Best Friends Girl: A Tribute to The Cars
DESCRIPTION:Saturday November 21st\, 2026\nDoors | 6:00 PM\nShow | 7:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $25.45 + Fees\nReserved Riser Seating | $29.55 + Fees\nReserved Mezzanine Seating | $32.65 + Fees\nReserved Balcony Seating | $36.75 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Shenny Enterprises\n—————————————————\nBest Friends Girl Americas Favorite Cars Experience \nBest Friends Girl recreate the timeless hits of The Cars spanning a 35-year career\, with over 23 million albums sold and having more than 22 songs on the Billboard top 100.  The Cars undoubtedly left their mark in popular culture with notable hits like “Best Friends Girl”\, “Shake It Up”\, “Magic”\, “Lets Go” and of course\, “Moving in Stereo” which gained notoriety from its placement in the movie -Fast Times at Ridgemont High-.  \nBest Friends Girl are comprised of lifelong\, top-notch\, professional musicians whose goal is to keep the music of The Cars alive with every performance! \nCheck out Best Friends Girl here!\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/best-friends-girl-a-tribute-to-the-cars/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2024/06/best-friends-Girl-image-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
