UID:55de6bd33762002a0ef84e1606627cff@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nKnitting Club typically me
 ets the 1st and 3rd Monday of the month\, from 10 a.m. until noon and the 
 second and last Tuesday of each month from 6 p.m. – 7:30 p.m.  Knitting 
 Club is for people who knit and like to share the craft. This is not a cla
 ss or instruction\, just a friendly gathering to knit and work on projects
