  - 2\, pink - 3\, etc. - this is part of the chaos fun!Hook - based on rec
 ommended size for yard being used (H/5mm\, I/5.5MM typically works for mos
 t projects and yarn weight)Recommend worsted weight or light/sport wright 
 yarn if making for babyScissorsStitch MarkersYarn NeedleSee right hand sid
