SUMMARY:November Movie Night!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThis month\, we've got some exc
 ellent film options! They include:\n\nDownfall (Der Untergang)\n-Trailer- 
 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uFG9a1NgfZA\n\nJudgement at Nuremburg\n-Tr
 ailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RfOgZXIQ6fo\n\nValkyrie\n-Trailer- 
 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-YppIQUiE9Y&t=4s\n\nMusk (Documentary)\n-T
 railer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FFTf1lzcs28\n\nWe cannot guarantee
  being able to show this new documentary this month\, but are interested i
 n getting ahold of a copy to show in the near future!\nNAZA (2026)\n-Trail
 er- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YIBRLEEaueo\n\nAnd many\, many more! B
 ring your own film selections and we may decide to show them!\n\nAdmission
  is Free! Bring as many family members and friends as you would like! Plea
 se RSVP! Discussion after the movie(s)\, hang out and share your thoughts!
 \n\nSome drinks and snacks will be provided\, please do bring more to shar
 e!\nPizza will be ordered\, please do chip in if you partake in delivered 
 food!\n\nSaturday\, November 28th\, 6:00pm - 10:00pm\nOther Room Theater\n
 715 N. Pine St.\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nWe can delay starting the movie to 
 give people time to arrive\, but no later than 6:30pm\, please try to arri
 ve before then if you do not want to miss any of the movie.\n\nPICTURED be
 low is the main entrance\, the event space is right up the stairs. On stre
 et parking should be available\, several public parking lots such as behin
 d CVS are within a 2 blocks walk along Harrisburg Pike.
