X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dungeons-and-dragons-adventure-club-kids-ages-9-12-only-2-168868"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Dungeons and Dragons Adventure Club for Kids (Ages 9-12 only)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261209T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261209T183000
UID:8096b2759b5baca0bb51e6743839e868@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Children\, Tweens\n\nTo ensure fair access for as man
 y families as possible\, please read the registration guidelines for this 
 program.One Session Per Month: Patrons may register for only one session o
 f this program per month.Duplicate Registrations: Registrations for more t
 han one session in the same month will be cancelled.We appreciate your und
 erstanding as we work to provide equitable access to this popular program.
 Calling all young adventurers ages 9 to 12! Join us for an exciting journe
 y into the world of Dungeons & Dragons\, where your imagination sets the c
 ourse. Together\, we’ll learn how to create unique characters\, navigate
  magical lands\, and solve thrilling quests. No prior experience is needed
 —new and experienced players alike are welcome!In each session\, you'll 
 explore stories full of mystery\, monsters\, and more all while working as
  a team to overcome challenges and puzzles. Whether you're a brave warrior
 \, a clever wizard\, or a sneaky rogue\, there’s always an adventure wai
 ting. Are you ready to roll the dice and discover where the story leads?Sp
 aces are limited\, so sign up today to secure your spot in our grand adven
 ture! All materials will be provided.Registration will open at 9:00AM on W
 ednesday\, November 25th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents 
 and on Wednesday\, December 2nd for residents of other municipalities.LIBR
 ARY PROGRAM POLICIES:Drop Off Program – This program is intended for chi
 ldren over the age of 9 years who can participate independently. Adult(s) 
 must be present to check in child with youth services staff prior to progr
 am. Adults will not be allowed in the event space. Designated Ages – Ple
 ase adhere to the age restrictions designated on your registration. Only c
 hildren in that age range will be admitted.Registration Requirements – T
 o help us manage our space\, please register every person who will be atte
 nding\, including siblings.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their reg
 istration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted f
 rom registering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Pl
 ease cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the 
 program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their cha
 nge in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prio
 r to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances
 . The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, y
 our spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted e
 ntry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. Howev
 er\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past
  the start time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dungeons-and-dragons-adv
 enture-club-kids-ages-9-12-only-2-168868
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
