DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Adults\n\nExperience the sights\, tastes\, and
  traditions of the holiday season in colonial America. Participants will e
 xplore how different colonies celebrated through historical foods\, festiv
 e decorations\, and engaging activities. This program is part of the Ameri
 ca 250 series. For adults. Registration is required.
