SUMMARY:2845 - Sourdough 101: Holiday Edition
DESCRIPTION:Known for his amazing sourdough\, Mike will guide you through the art of crafting this beloved bread with a festive twist. Learn how to create and maintain your starter\, master the process from start to finish\, and explore how to add seasonal mix-ins like. Taste a special chocolate chip gingerbread sourdough with butter and jams\, and take home a starter kit so you can keep baking fresh bread all season long. Expect plenty of Q&A time and Mike’s signature dad jokes to keep you entertained. \nDemonstration. Ages 16 and up. \n\nCreate and maintain your sourdough starter\nStep-by-step process to bake 2 loaves\nHow to add seasonal mix-ins\nTaste various sourdough breads including Chocolate Chip Gingerbread Sourdough with Butter and Jams\nTake-home kit with starter and baking essentials
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2845-sourdough-101-holiday-edition/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 35 S. Willowdale drive\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Basics and Techniques,Healthy Eating,Let's Bake,Seasonal
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://zestchef.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sourdough-101-scaled-e1743620961517.jpg
