BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/word-mail-merge-206373"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Word: Mail Merge
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261217T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261217T163000
UID:188d2605f5eff855ec6c51b64c781284@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Technology Class\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nThis class will focus o
 n what mail merge is\, how it works and why it is a useful skill. Particip
 ants will be able to understand the three parts of the process including t
 he main document\, the data source and the merged document. This is also a
  great class for people who would like to learn to make a database of mail
