SUMMARY:2853 - Date Night: Feast of the Seven Fishes 
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Christmas Eve the Italian way with a festive Feast of the 7 Fishes cooking class! Chef Helen Chudakova-Sanya will guide you through preparing a variety of seafood dishes – from light starters to a hearty entrée\, showcasing the flavors and traditions of this beloved holiday meal. In just two hours\, you’ll learn approachable techniques\, enjoy plenty of hands-on cooking\, and create a celebratory spread perfect for sharing with family and friends. \nPartial Hands on. Ages 21 and up.Gluten Free Friendly. \n\nTuna Stuffed Warm Olives\nSausage and Mussels in Tomato Broth\nShrimp Scampi with Fresh Herbs\nCrab Cakes with Remoulade\nRoasted Branzino with Lemon and Herbs\nEggnog Panna Cotta \nWhite Sangria with Winter Citrus
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2853-date-night-feast-of-seven-fishes/
LOCATION:Zest Cooking School\, 35 S. Willowdale drive\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Date Night,Festive,Fine Dining,Seasonal,Special Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://zestchef.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/feast-of-7-fishes-scaled-e1726060330738.jpg
