BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/celebrate-season-movie-screening-polar-express-211850"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Celebrate the Season with a Movie Screening of The Polar Express
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261221T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261221T123000
UID:2f4fc3b7dc3afdee6b412826aada2965@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Movie & Film\, Babies\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\,
  Adults\n\nJoin us for a magical morning as we celebrate the season with T
 he Polar Express movie! Get cozy in your pajamas\, bring your favorite bla
 nket and pillow\, and step into the holiday spirit.Event Highlights:Golden
  Tickets: Each child will receive their very own golden ticket to board Th
 e Polar Express!Hot Chocolate and cookies: All child passengers can warm u
 p with delicious hot chocolate—just like on the train!Cozy Vibes: Enjoy 
 the movie in comfort with your blankets and pillows.Photo Booth: Take pict
 ures of your family in front of our holiday backdrop.All aboard for an unf
 orgettable holiday adventure! Perfect for families and kids of all ages. 
 ✨🚂Don’t forget—pajamas encouraged! 🎄🎬All aboard at 10:30 am
 . Movie will start promptly at 10:45 am. The Polar Express is Rated G.Plea
 se only register the children who will be attending\, not adults.Registrat
 ion will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, December 9th for Manheim Township a
 nd East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, December 16th for residents 
 of other municipalities.Children's Programming PoliciesNo Show – Patrons
  failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in 
 a month will be restricted from registering for future programs for a peri
 od of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hour
 s prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list
  to be notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – P
 lease arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for par
 king and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the desig
 nated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wai
 t list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be all
 owed into the program. Accompanying Adults – This program is for adults 
 and children to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged with 
 your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check yo
 ur email prior to departing to verify that the program has not been cancel
 led.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/celebrate-season-movie-s
 creening-polar-express-211850
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
