X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup The Creative House Of Lancaster": "https://www.meetup.com/the-creative-house-of-lancaster/events/vtdfztyjcqbjc/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_the_creative_house_of_lancaster
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Creative House of Lancaster
UID:event_vtdfztyjcqbjc@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261114T061421Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261226T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261226T120000
SUMMARY:Creative Release Open Studio Saturday
DESCRIPTION:The Creative House of Lancaster\n#### ***A Place to Make Art T
 ogether***\n\n**When:** Every Other Saturday from 10am - 12pm\n**Where:** 
 [The Candy Factory](https://share.google/nqC7VtCS6IcDeBRyg)\n**Cost:** Fre
 e & Open to the Public\n**Ages:** All Ages\n\n**Upcoming Dates**\nJuly 11\
 , July 25\, Aug 8\, Aug 22\, Sept 5\, Sept 19\, Oct 3\, Oct 17\, Oct 31\, 
 Nov 14\, Nov 28\, Dec 9\, Dec 23\n\n*Do you have creative aspirations but 
 never seem to make the time? Do you want the companionship of others to ov
 ercome your creative blocks and “just do it”?*\n\nCreative Release pro
 vides spaces and resources that make artmaking accessible. Whether you’r
 e an experienced artist or just looking to explore your creative side\, Cr
 eative Release is a safe place to explore your ideas with others. Bring yo
 ur ongoing projects or use the art materials available.\n\nDon't have a pr
 oject at the moment? That's just fine. I’ll have materials to share.\n**
 What to Expect:**\n\n* A welcoming\, inclusive environment\n* A variety of
  art materials to experiment with\n* Demonstrations on how to use differen
 t art materials\n* The opportunity to work on your personal projects\n* Th
 e chance to meet and collaborate with fellow creatives\n* A moment to rela
 x\, create\, and escape the usual routine\n\n**Who Should Join?**\nAnyone 
 and everyone! Bring an idea for a card\, a knitting pattern you’ve been 
 wanting to try\, a shirt that needs mending\, or a full-on canvas and pain
 ts. Most of all\, bring your lovely self! We believe in the power of commu
 nity and creativity.\n\n[Event Link](https://www.jodavis.art/community-eve
 nts-1/creative-release)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/the-creative-house-of-lancaster/event
 s/vtdfztyjcqbjc/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260703T133334Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260703T133334Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/carlson-kids-art-library-200550"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Carlson Kids! Art at the Library!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261226T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261226T120000
UID:216d9401bf53e893a8bcf682ee5b4931@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Children\, Tweens\n\nAges 6-12\, children unde
 r 8 should have responsible caregiver present.Our main program room is nam
 ed for Charles X. Carlson\, the notable local artist. And what more fittin
 g purpose than to use it to inspire a new generation of artists! Carlson K
 ids is a grant-funded program that brings together a local art teacher\, s
 ome aspiring teen coaches\, and young future artists!  Students will do ar
 t activities in similar styles to Charlie Carlson's work\, which includes 
 watercolor\, collage\, cartooning\, and some experimental projects. This p
 rogram will be offered on one Thursday afternoon and one Saturday afternoo
 n per month. You may register for any sessions you wish\, attendance at al
 l sessions is not mandatory. We gratefully acknowledge the C. X. Carlson C
 ultural Trust Fund for their generosity in providing this program to our c
 ommunity.
LOCATION:Quarryville\, QVL C.X. Carlson Cultural Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/carlson-kids-art-library
 -200550
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
