UID:e2d677878747967b7fbbbf940484ef91@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Teens\n\nGather for an afternoon of Dungeons and Drag
 ons with Dungeon Master Jason Mowery. Players should be able to commit to 
 a 3 month session\, the fourth Saturday of every month\, from 1:00-4:00. R
 egistration for the next session will open by the 15th of the month prior 
 to a new session. (Check the calendar in March\, June\, September and Dece
 mber.)Sessions in 2026 will run:Session 1: January/February/MarchSession 2
 : April/May/JuneSession 3: July/August/SeptemberSession 4: October/Novembe
 r/December
LOCATION:Milanof-Schock\, MJY Engle Room Large
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dungeons-and-dragons-202
 310
