 on email platforms. Learners will practice basic email functions\, such as
  sending\, receiving and replying to email. Also\, they will learn to reco
 gnize and deal with spam\, organize and delete emails\, and search for mes
 sages. Participants should create a Google Account before class. Please sc
 hedule an appointment with a computer tutor or utilize the library lab hou
 rs if you need help creating the account. Bring your email account and pas
 sword to class so you can practice!
