 \, Teens\n\n🎨 The Youth Craft Club: Unplug & Get Creative!Ready to make
  something cool? Join us for The Youth Craft Club\, a fun\, hands-on space
  where you can let your imagination run wild! Whether you're hanging out w
 ith friends or making new ones\, come kick back and create something uniqu
 ely yours.✨ Some Materials We Will Be Working With:🎨 Paper Crafts & P
 ainting: Express yourself with bold colors\, custom designs\, and fresh ar
 twork to take home.📿 DIY Bracelets & Keychains: Bead\, braid\, and desi
 gn personalized accessories for your backpack\, keys\, or besties!📌 Vis
 ion & Mood Boards: Map out your vibe\, aesthetic\, and big goals with coll
 ages\, quotes\, and cutouts.🌟 Every Month is a New Creative Mix!Project
  activities vary by session—the list above highlights the types of craft
 s and materials in our studio toolkit. Depending on which night you join u
 s\, you’ll dive into a fresh mix of hands-on projects! Come to one night
  or come to them all to try something new each time.✂️ No supplies nee
 ded—all materials are provided free!Grab a spot\, bring your ideas\, and
  let’s get crafting!
