DESCRIPTION:Community\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nEnergy Efficiency and Electrif
 ication BasicsDoes your home feel cold this winter? Is your heating bill h
 igher than it should be? Are you looking for ways to live in ways that are
  gentler on Planet Earth? Join Andrew Pauls-Thomas\, Director of Energy So
 lutions at RegenAll for an overview of energy efficiency basics as well as
  ideas for reducing or eliminating fossil fuel use in your home. Andrew wi
 ll touch on solutions to match every budget and every home – from simple
  DIY caulking to full replacement of your heating system.This program is i
 n partnership with RegenAll\, an organization that is committed to resilie
 nce and climate work done with communities\, not for them. Registration is
  helpful\, but walk-ins will not be turned away.Ages 18+
