 t be 18 months-younger 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is re
 quired)Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Ple
 ase add any additional registrants to your registration if more than one c
 hild that will be participating in the program.Registration will open at 9
 :00AM on Wednesday\, January 20th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter r
 esidents and on Friday\, January 22nd for residents of other municipalitie
 s.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registrati
 on for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from reg
 istering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please ca
 ncel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program
  to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in 
 registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to th
 e start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The p
 rogram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spo
 t will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. I
 f spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, re
 gistrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the st
 art time.Accompanying Adults – This program is for adults and children t
 o enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Dr
 op offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior
  to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled.Program Li
 mits - Patrons are limited to one session of multiple session programs per
  week.
