 p and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, January 29th for residents o
 f other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesProgram Limits - Patrons are limi
 ted to one session of multiple session programs per week.Cancellations- Pl
 ease check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has no
 t been cancelled.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration 
