 ook Sale!📅 Sale Days & TimesFriday\, February 12 · 9AM-5PMSaturday\, F
 ebruary 13 · 9AM-5PMSunday\, February 14 · 9AM-3PM📚 Library Lover tip
 : Sunday is half price day!🛍️ From books & DVDs to audiobooks & vinyl
  records\, there are thousands of items available at exceptional values! T
 his year\, we have a HUGE selection of audiobooks on CD. Additionally\, we
  have MANY Great Courses on CD and DVD!📍 Sale held at the Book ReSort\,
  located at 225 N. Marshall Street in Lancaster.💥 Over half the items p
 riced between 50¢ and $2!💥 Free parking! The parking lot fills up fast
  on Day 1💥 Marshall Street Bookstore OPEN during the Book Sale!GOOD TO 
 KNOW INFO:Cash\, checks\, and all major credit cards accepted.Due to an in
 crease in counterfeit currency\, we regret we cannot accept bills over $20
